[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * The only size constant is `#define BUFFER_SIZE 256`, used solely as the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `snprintf` bound in `envy`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * Every rejection in this library is therefore one of three shapes:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   (a) a null / sentinel check on a `getenv` or `strchr` result that falls back
