[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    796[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // its low 4 bits set (`| 0x0F`) plus base_offset 64, so results equal to
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    797[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // param1 with param1 having clear low bits are recoveries.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    798[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     {
